Help                                                ●
Keys
j/k            move
enter          pick this board
f              find by name: type to filter every
               group; enter keeps it, esc clears it,
               backspace deletes
esc            back
hold tab       lock the screen (3 s); tab then enter
               unlocks
Ctrl+C         quit, from anywhere (asks first while
               flashing; a setup stops where it is)

j/k scroll  space page  any other key back